cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated article."
title: "cimcdm: Cloud-Integration Multicriteria Decision Model"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and reproducibility archive for a time-aware,
  three-objective binary portfolio model that selects distributed
  information-processing systems for cloud integration. The package reproduces
  the article's exact enumeration of 262,144 portfolios, its matched NSGA-II /
  NSGA-III / weighted-sum comparison, its paired Wilcoxon tests with Holm
  correction, and its 25-cell temporal-rate sensitivity analysis.
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-02"
license: MIT
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/omega2417/bnt"
keywords:
  - cloud integration
  - distributed information processing
  - multicriteria optimization
  - NSGA-II
  - NSGA-III
  - Pareto front
  - sensitivity analysis
  - reproducibility

